@*
===========================================================
ORANGE TENDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
PAGE: Management Statistics

DEVELOPER OWNER: UNASSIGNED — Team assignment required
MODULE: Top Committee
TRELLO TASK: None — no dedicated Trello card
TRELLO URL: —

PURPOSE:
Management view required by the specification: awarded
tenders and totals per supplier.

BUSINESS ACCESS:
Top Committee member

ROUTE: /TopCommittee/Statistics

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- Aggregate from Tenders.AwardedBidId → Bid →
  TenderInvitation → Supplier.
- Non-confidential aggregates only.

DEPENDENCIES:
Tenders, Bids, BidItems, TenderInvitations, Suppliers.

STATUS:
UI SCAFFOLD ONLY — BUSINESS LOGIC NOT IMPLEMENTED.

IMPORTANT:
In the specification (section 9) but no Trello card — team
assignment required.
===========================================================
*@
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Management Statistics";
    ViewData["WorkspaceSection"] = "Management Statistics";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Totals by supplier and how often each supplier was awarded.";
}
<partial name="_PageHeader" />
<partial name="_ScaffoldNotice" />

<section class="pg-cards" aria-label="Summary">
    <article class="pg-card"><span>Awarded tenders</span><strong>—</strong><small>Not connected</small></article>
    <article class="pg-card"><span>Total awarded value</span><strong>—</strong><small>Not connected</small></article>
    <article class="pg-card"><span>Active tenders</span><strong>—</strong><small>Not connected</small></article>
    <article class="pg-card"><span>Suppliers awarded</span><strong>—</strong><small>Not connected</small></article>
</section>

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel" aria-labelledby="tbl-awards-by-supplier">
    <div class="pg-panel-head"><h2 id="tbl-awards-by-supplier">Awards by supplier</h2></div>
    <div class="pg-table-wrap">
        <table class="pg-table">
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">Supplier</th><th scope="col">Awarded tenders</th><th scope="col">Total awarded value</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody><tr><td colspan="3"><partial name="_EmptyState" model='"No awards recorded yet."' /></td></tr></tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>
